    "detailed_description": "Being hopeless is the feeling you will encounter when you meet the dreadful situations that you will have to face in <strong>Umbra</strong>, an abyss where the worst horrors that a human can imagine reside, do you dare to face them?<br><br><u><strong><i>SYNOPSIS</i></strong></u><br><br>While you try to find a way out, you will have some obstacles... Amon Morgan &amp; Blair Cunningham, with their thirst for blood, will do their best to destroy all hope of getting out of this hell.<br>You are Jesse Miller, and your mission is to <u>NOT</u> lose hope, and to keep going while you discover gloomy stories and realize that there is more than meets the eye regarding the place you are in...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137920/extras/abcd1ebfabeaee9b22e2aa999ec56fb6.avif?t=1695915478\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Basic Survival Guide:</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Always keep your stamina high! don't run for no reason, that could cost you your existence.<br></li><li> Try to find batteries, the light of your flashlight is not infinite!<br></li><li> Be aware of the sound effects, they could reveal valuable information!<br></li><li> Always peek around corners before continuing on your way, someone could be waiting for you around the corner!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137920/extras/753e6529d8fb8154b07dfad5dddacbc8.avif?t=1695915478\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Features</u>:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> First-Person Survival-Horror Free Roam experience<br></li><li> Complex AI with voice lines that will be stuck in your head!<br></li><li> Multiple objectives, one more challenging than the other.<br></li><li> Beautiful graphics with AAA-quality scenarios.<br></li><li> Gloomy soundtrack, which perfectly captured the scene.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137920/extras/b28a8cc77e3259480e06dd87ca6782c1.poster.avif?t=1695915478\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137920/extras/b28a8cc77e3259480e06dd87ca6782c1.webm?t=1695915478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137920/extras/b28a8cc77e3259480e06dd87ca6782c1.mp4?t=1695915478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
